TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3560103442,"text":"おい見ろ、誰かいるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[752460102]},{"nodeId":752460102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4067253426,"text":"あれ？この後ろ姿は…","nextNodeIds":[752460103]},{"nodeId":752460103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3158060946,"text":"オロルンとイファじゃないか！","nextNodeIds":[752460104]},{"nodeId":752460104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1239910946,"text":"#聞き覚えのある声…{M#じいちゃん}{F#ばあちゃん}とパイモンか。","nextNodeIds":[752460105]},{"nodeId":752460105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21971,"speakerName":"カクーク","textMapHash":4252441290,"text":"よう、きょうだい！","nextNodeIds":[752460106]},{"nodeId":752460106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":3583386330,"text":"久しぶりだな。あんたらまでリゾートに来てたとは。","nextNodeIds":[752460107]},{"nodeId":752460107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1052525482,"text":"チャスカからおまえたちがリゾートで働いてるとは聞いてたけど…ここで会えるとは思わなかったぞ。","nextNodeIds":[752460108]},{"nodeId":752460108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":855259874,"text":"同感だ。ここはいい場所だな。みんなも楽しく遊べてるみたいでよかった。","nextNodeIds":[752460109]},{"nodeId":752460109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1586114978,"text":"へへっ、もっともっと盛り上がって、いっぱい観光客が来るといいよな！","nextNodeIds":[752460110]},{"nodeId":752460110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":30030474,"text":"仕事のほうはどうなんだ？順調か？","nextNodeIds":[752460111]},{"nodeId":752460111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":1016331050,"text":"ああ、竜のスタッフもミツムシも健康そのもの、元気いっぱいだ。おかげさまで、俺たちもあちこち見てまわれそうだ。","nextNodeIds":[752460112]},{"nodeId":752460112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":170315498,"text":"…スタッフ。","nextNodeIds":[752460113]},{"nodeId":752460113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":3668683794,"text":"ん？","nextNodeIds":[752460114]},{"nodeId":752460114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":2566931834,"text":"「竜のスタッフ」と「ミツムシのスタッフ」、だ。「スタッフ」が一つ漏れていた。","nextNodeIds":[752460115]},{"nodeId":752460115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21971,"speakerName":"カクーク","textMapHash":883058178,"text":"そうだぞ、きょうだい！","nextNodeIds":[752460116]},{"nodeId":752460116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":3597923722,"text":"ああ…それはすまなかった。全てのスタッフと、スタッフのために奔走してる「オロルンさん」に敬意を払わないとな。","nextNodeIds":[752460117]},{"nodeId":752460117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":3255111962,"text":"早くから動いて、大事な事のために闘う——僕たちはこうあるべきだ。","nextNodeIds":[752460118]},{"nodeId":752460118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":747743626,"text":"初めて正式な招待状を貰ったもんだから、舞い上がってるんだ。気にしないでくれ。","nextNodeIds":[752460119]},{"nodeId":752460119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2148736290,"text":"熱心なのはいいこと。","nextNodeIds":[752460120]},{"nodeId":752460120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":77593482,"text":"#ほら、{M#じいちゃん}{F#ばあちゃん}もこう言ってる。","nextNodeIds":[752460121]},{"nodeId":752460121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":2578538954,"text":"カクークが教えてくれたんだ。大切にしなくてもいい日なんてない——毎日大切なものを守るために仕事をするんだって。","nextNodeIds":[752460122]},{"nodeId":752460122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21971,"speakerName":"カクーク","textMapHash":2331991114,"text":"ははっ！","nextNodeIds":[752460123]},{"nodeId":752460123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1438549826,"text":"でも…魚を釣ってるようにしか見えないぞ？釣りが「大切なものを守るための仕事」なのか？","nextNodeIds":[752460124]},{"nodeId":752460124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21971,"speakerName":"カクーク","textMapHash":403614842,"text":"なにデタラメ言ってんだ？","nextNodeIds":[752460125]},{"nodeId":752460125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":2837898778,"text":"ああ、ある友人に釣りを勧められたんだ。彼はモンドの有名な冒険家で、すごく運がいいんだ…彼の言うことを聞いておけば間違いない。","nextNodeIds":[752460126]},{"nodeId":752460126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3293702314,"text":"（まさか…ベネット？）","nextNodeIds":[752460127]},{"nodeId":752460127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":3169588506,"text":"そいつの投げた木の枝が、この池を指し示した。オロルンが「あれこれ悩むより導かれるがままに進んだ方がいい」っていうもんだから、こうして釣りしてるわけさ。","nextNodeIds":[752460128]},{"nodeId":752460128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":683441194,"text":"なるほどな…でもさっきからずっとツッコミたかったんだけど…池の周りがカピバラだらけだぞ！こんなところで本当に釣れるのか？","nextNodeIds":[752460129]},{"nodeId":752460129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":3520276570,"text":"大丈夫だ。カピバラは温厚な性格で、めったに攻撃してこない。ばあちゃんも「水場があるなら釣りをしろ」と言っていた。","nextNodeIds":[752460130]},{"nodeId":752460130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":31569538,"text":"ばあちゃんは「飯があったら食え」「長いものがあったら巻かれろ」とも言ってたけどな。","nextNodeIds":[752460131]},{"nodeId":752460131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":632590890,"text":"#{M#じいちゃん}{F#ばあちゃん}とパイモンも、せっかくだから長いものに巻かれていかないか。","nextNodeIds":[752460132]},{"nodeId":752460132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":3193986962,"text":"一番大きい魚を釣り上げたら、こいつの蜜酒がもらえるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[752460133]},{"nodeId":752460133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2281253290,"text":"わぁ！それを早く言えよな♪","nextNodeIds":[752460134]},{"nodeId":752460134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3605123010,"text":"へへっ、ここで会ったが百年目…売られた勝負は受けて立つ！旅人が相手だ！","nextNodeI