着け…おっ、来たぞ！","nextNodeIds":[752460311,752460313]},{"nodeId":752460311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":2664107354,"text":"イファは全力で竿を引っ張った。どうやら大物が釣れたようだ。","nextNodeIds":[752460312]},{"nodeId":752460312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":2014304514,"text":"しかし、浮かび上がってきたのは…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":752460313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2555166306,"text":"えっと…イファ選手が釣り上げたのは…コホラ竜…カピバラ付き？なんでこいつら一緒に揚がってきたんだ？","nextNodeIds":[752460314]},{"nodeId":752460314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":4279945818,"text":"さすがだ。ここでも動物に好かれてるな。","nextNodeIds":[752460315]},{"nodeId":752460315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":1648798330,"text":"待て、このコホラ竜の尻尾、何かおかしいぞ…もしかして、水底の石に引っかかっていたところを、カピバラが助けようとしてたのか？","nextNodeIds":[752460316]},{"nodeId":752460316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":2716216578,"text":"カピバラがコホラ竜のしっぽを食べようとしていたのかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[752460317]},{"nodeId":752460317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":4279577626,"text":"それはないだろ、きょうだい。カクーク、聞いてみてくれるか？","nextNodeIds":[752460318]},{"nodeId":752460318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21971,"speakerName":"カクーク","textMapHash":3603744170,"text":"うん、うん…あってたぞ、きょうだい！","nextNodeIds":[752460319]},{"nodeId":752460319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":3852747154,"text":"な、俺の言う通りだっただろ…って、そんな場合じゃないか！","nextNodeIds":[752460320,752460322]},{"nodeId":752460320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":1091354402,"text":"イファはコホラ竜の尻尾を素早くチェックした。幸い、軽いかすり傷だけで、特に問題はなかった。","nextNodeIds":[752460321]},{"nodeId":752460321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":37365746,"text":"簡単に消毒し、薬を塗ると、コホラ竜とカピバラは共に去っていった。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":752460322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":509300586,"text":"友達ができたのか。今日はあいつらにとっても「ツイてる日」だな。","nextNodeIds":[752460323]},{"nodeId":752460323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":632245546,"text":"あいつらにとって「も」？","nextNodeIds":[752460324]},{"nodeId":752460324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1106378922,"text":"ああ、勝てる予感がする。次は僕が「闘う」番だ。","nextNodeIds":[752460325]},{"nodeId":752460325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21971,"speakerName":"カクーク","textMapHash":1243249178,"text":"手を貸せ！きょうだい！","nextNodeIds":[752460326]},{"nodeId":752460326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":3381452002,"text":"一体どこでそんな言葉を学んだんだ…俺たちを応援してるつもりか？","nextNodeIds":[752460327]},{"nodeId":752460327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2024950090,"text":"カクークは釣りのチアリーダーだね。","nextNodeIds":[752460328]},{"nodeId":752460328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":823426546,"text":"僕たちは闘っているのだから、「闘いのチアリーダー」というべきだ。そっちの方が壮大…うっ！？","nextNodeIds":[752460329]},{"nodeId":752460329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":3136456898,"text":"何だ！？みんな避けろ！","nextNodeIds":[752460330]},{"nodeId":752460330,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":933022922,"text":"ちょっと様子が変だけど…またカピバラだ！穏やかな性格だとか言ってた割に、やる気満々みたいだな…","nextNodeIds":[752460331]},{"nodeId":752460331,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":2494077474,"text":"こいつもきっと大事なことのために闘ってるんだろう。僕にはわかる…","nextNodeIds":[752460332]},{"nodeId":752460332,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":3534229042,"text":"…うん？何かおかしい…","nextNodeIds":[752460333]},{"nodeId":752460333,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21978,"speakerName":"カピバラ","textMapHash":2187188738,"text":"——！","nextNodeIds":[752460334]},{"nodeId":752460334,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1399225434,"text":"機嫌が悪いみたいだ。闘わなければいけないのは僕たちの方らしい。","nextNodeIds":[752460335]},{"nodeId":752460335,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21971,"speakerName":"カクーク","textMapHash":3096691786,"text":"おお、友よ！","nextNodeIds":[752460336]},{"nodeId":752460336,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21978,"speakerName":"カピバラ","textMapHash":3952468962,"text":"——？","nextNodeIds":[752460337]},{"nodeId":752460337,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21971,"speakerName":"カクーク","textMapHash":54244562,"text":"ははっ！最高だな、きょうだい！","nextNodeIds":[752460338]},{"nodeId":752460338,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":138082,"text":"ど、どういうことだ？カクークはなにをいってるんだ？","nextNodeIds":[752460339]},{"nodeId":752460339,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":601693058,"text":"なだめてるみたいだな。こう見えても、カクークは患者の気持ちを落ち着かせるのが得意なんだ。","nextNodeIds":[752460340]},{"nodeId":752460340,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3499982858,"text":"なるほど。でも、カクークの語彙力で大丈夫か？","nextNodeIds":[752460341]},{"nodeId":752460341,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":3444039394,"text":"パイモン、そもそも人間の言葉はカピバラに通じない。","nextNodeIds":[752460342]},{"nodeId":752460342,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2970683018,"text":"あれ？確かに！","nextNodeIds":[752460343]},{"nodeId":752460343,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1425502162,"text":"こういう時は、きょうだいを信じるしかない。","nextNodeIds":[752460344]},{"nodeId":752460344,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":4001775978,"text":"それに、コミュニケーションにおいては内容よりも声のトーンのほうが大事だと思う。","nextNodeIds":[752460345]},{"nodeId":752460345,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":3611376050,"text":"例えば、「こんにちは」。これは嬉しがってる。","nextNodeIds":[752460346]},{"nodeId":752460346,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":3632309994,"text":"「こんにちは」…は困ってる。","nextNodeIds":[752460347]},{"nodeId":752460347,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1971299682,"text":"「こんにちは」！これは怒ってる。一般的に、危機が迫ってるから、避けなければいけないと感じさせる。","nextNodeIds":[752460348]},{"nodeId":752460348,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2863757570,"text":"なんとなくわかったけど、それだけで伝わるとは思えないぞ…","nextNodeIds":[752460349]},{"nodeId":752460349,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3683240242,"text":"勉強になった。ありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[752460350]},{"nodeId":752460350,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":3446834810,"text":"本当か？それなら嬉しい。僕もいつもこうしてミツムシとコミュニケーションを取ってる。","nextNodeIds":[752460351]},{"nodeId":752460351,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":3334796746,"text":"「スタッフ」、だろ。「ミツムシのスタッフ」。","nextNodeIds":[752460352]},{"nodeId":752460352,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":747798938,"text":"スタッフになりたくないミツムシだっている。僕は彼らの気持ちや選択も受け止めるし、尊重する。","nextNodeIds":[752460353]},{"nodeId":752460353,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":2483015890,"text":"…じゃあ、今は俺のこの複雑な心境を理解してほしいところだな。","nextNodeIds":[752460354]},{"nodeId":752460354,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1466695370,"text":"何故だ？誇りに思うべきなんじゃないか？ほら。","nextNodeIds":[752460355]},{"nodeId":752460355,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21978,"speakerName":"カピバラ","textMapHash":1963398298,"text":"——。","nextNodeIds":[752460356]},{"nodeId":752460356,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21971,"speakerName":"カクーク","textMapHash":656747410,"text":"ははっ！だろ？","nextNodeIds":[752460357]},{"nodeId":752460357,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21978,"speakerName":"カピバラ","textMapHash":1068235698,"text":"——。","nextNodeIds":[752460358]},{"nodeId":752460358,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21971,"speakerName":"カクーク","textMapHash":41773842,"text":"マジかよ！マジかよ！","nextNodeIds":[752460359]},{"nodeId":752460359,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":626921514,"text":"ずいぶん盛り上がってるな…","nextNodeIds":[752460360]},{"nodeId":752460360,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":3124241842,"text":"誇りに思わないこともないけど…って、えっ？おい、オロルン！","nextNodeIds":[752460361]},{"nodeId":752460361,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1475550898,"text":"心配するな。何とかする。","nextNodeIds":[752460362]},{"nodeId":752460362,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":227943658,"text":"こんにちは、カピバラキング。お菓子を食べないか？イファが作った、出来立てのクッキーだ。","nextNodeIds":[752460363]},{"nodeId":752460363,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21978,"speakerName":"カピバラ","textMapHash":2607678602,"text":"ウ…","nextNodeIds":[752460364]},{"nodeId":752460364,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":2844821810,"text":"カピバラキング？","nextNodeIds":[752460365]},{"nodeId":752460365,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":97334746,"text":"食べた！嬉しそうにしてるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[752460366]},{"nodeId":752460366,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21971,"speakerName":"カクーク","textMapHash":2416118058,"text":"やれやれ！","nextNodeIds":[752460367]},{"nodeId":752460367,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2288266722,"text":"ところで、オイラたち釣り大会をやってたはずだよな。もはや、動物園みたいになってるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[752460368,752460369]},{"nodeId":752460368,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1124269010,"text":"それもいいんじゃない？","nextNodeIds":[752460370]},{"nodeId":752460370,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":322554666,"text":"それもそうだな…じゃあ、今回の釣り大会の優勝者は、オロルンってことでいいよな？","nextNodeIds":[752460371]},{"nodeId":752460371,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":738449922,"text":"なんたって…あの「カピバラキング」を釣ったんだからな。","nextNodeIds":[752460372]},{"nodeId":752460372,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1417480362,"text":"いい名前だね。","nextNodeIds":[752460373]},{"nodeId":752460373,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":2730836466,"text":"はぁ、オロルンでいいや。どうせ誰も魚を釣れなかったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[752460374]},{"nodeId":752460374,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21971,"speakerName":"カクーク","textMapHash":3184098186,"text":"ははっ！","nextNodeIds":[752460375]},{"nodeId":752460375,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":789521642,"text":"それじゃあ、蜜酒は僕のものだな。やった…って、元々僕のものじゃないか。","nextNodeIds":[752460376]},{"nodeId":752460376,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":252079370,"text":"持ってたものを守り抜けたのも、ある意味「ツイてる」んじゃないか？","nextNodeIds":[752460377]},{"nodeId":752460377,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21850,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":645438786,"text":"確かに。それに、ほかにも収穫があった。ほら、カピバラキングからの贈り物。","nextNodeIds":[752460378]},{"nodeId":752460378,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":3809075946,"text":"「キラキラエッグ」と一枚の写真か。この場所、なんとなく見覚えがあるな…","nextNodeIds":[752460379]},{"nodeId":752460379,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3412133922,"text":"オイラたちにここに行って欲しいのか？なんかそんな感じがするぞ。","nextNodeIds":[752460380]},{"nodeId":752460380,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":705119154,"text":"探してみよう。","nextNodeIds":[752460381]},{"nodeId":752460381,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":1560584314,"text":"俺もそう思ってたところだ。みんな、写真に映ってる場所を覚えといてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[752460382]},{"nodeId":752460382,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3263305626,"text":"#いいものが待ってるといい{M#な}{F#ね}。","nextNodeIds":[752460383]},{"nodeId":752460383,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21849,"speakerName":"イファ","textMapHash":2782365018,"text":"何があるかわからない…念のため、準備は万全にしていこう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":752460369,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1182698514,"text":"和やかでいい。","nextNodeIds":[752460370]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7524603,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_INIT_TIME_VAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133520019,2"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["21850"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7524602,"order":99,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":1029365100,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7524602,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_N